From ea9ec73c73c4bd3637d1087f701d64ca7630d3a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: g1-door <g1-door@local>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:51:05 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] sim: armature/joint friction multipliers in config
 (simulator.config.armature_scale/joint_friction_scale, defaults 3/0 as
 before, fixes 1 and 6), Isaac Lab events for torso mass, actuator gains,
 joint friction and pushing (push was a no-op in Isaac Sim, fix 4), per
 physics step monitor of arm torque saturation and arm-to-body contact with
 penalties (fixes 3 and C); all default off (10-26)

